{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# EDA - UNSW-NB15 Network Intrusion Detection Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "Notebook ini melakukan eksplorasi data awal (Exploratory Data Analysis) pada dataset UNSW-NB15 untuk memahami karakteristik data sebelum membangun pipeline TFX."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Import Library"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.sans-serif'] = ['DejaVu Sans']\n",
    "plt.rcParams['axes.unicode_minus'] = False\n",
    "sns.set_style('whitegrid')\n",
    "print('Library loaded successfully')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Load Dataset"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df_train = pd.read_parquet('../data/UNSW_NB15_training-set.parquet')\n",
    "df_test = pd.read_parquet('../data/UNSW_NB15_testing-set.parquet')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Training set: {df_train.shape[0]} baris, {df_train.shape[1]} kolom')\n",
    "print(f'Testing set:  {df_test.shape[0]} baris, {df_test.shape[1]} kolom')\n",
    "print(f'\nTotal data: {df_train.shape[0] + df_test.shape[0]} baris')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Shape & Info Dataset"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('=== Training Set Info ===')\n",
    "print(f'Jumlah baris: {df_train.shape[0]:,}')\n",
    "print(f'Jumlah kolom: {df_train.shape[1]}')\n",
    "print(f'\nTipe data per kolom:')\n",
    "print(df_train.dtypes.value_counts())\n",
    "print(f'\nDetail tipe data:')\n",
    "for dtype, count in df_train.dtypes.value_counts().items():\n",
    "    cols = df_train.dtypes[df_train.dtypes == dtype].index.tolist()\n",
    "    print(f'  {dtype} ({count} kolom): {cols}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('=== Sample Data (5 baris pertama) ===')\n",
    "df_train.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Missing Value Check"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('=== Missing Value Check ===')\n",
    "train_missing = df_train.isnull().sum()\n",
    "test_missing = df_test.isnull().sum()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Training set - Total missing: {train_missing.sum()}')\n",
    "print(f'Testing set  - Total missing: {test_missing.sum()}')\n",
    "\n",
    "if train_missing.sum() == 0:\n",
    "    print('\nKesimpulan: Tidak ada missing value pada training set.')\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('\nKolom dengan missing value (training):')\n",
    "    print(train_missing[train_missing > 0])\n",
    "\n",
    "if test_missing.sum() > 0:\n",
    "    print('\nKolom dengan missing value (testing):')\n",
    "    print(test_missing[test_missing > 0])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Distribusi Label (Target)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Label distribution (binary)\n",
    "label_counts = df_train['label'].value_counts().sort_index()\n",
    "colors = ['#2ecc71', '#e74c3c']\n",
    "labels_text = ['Normal (0)', 'Attack (1)']\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].bar(labels_text, label_counts.values, color=colors, edgecolor='white', linewidth=1.5)\n",
    "axes[0].set_title('Distribusi Label (Training Set)', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "axes[0].set_ylabel('Jumlah Sampel')\n",
    "for i, v in enumerate(label_counts.values):\n",
    "    axes[0].text(i, v + 1000, f'{v:,} ({v/len(df_train)*100:.1f}%)',\n",
    "                ha='center', fontweight='bold', fontsize=11)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Attack category distribution\n",
    "cat_counts = df_train['attack_cat'].value_counts()\n",
    "colors_cat = plt.cm.Set3(np.linspace(0, 1, len(cat_counts)))\n",
    "axes[1].barh(cat_counts.index, cat_counts.values, color=colors_cat, edgecolor='white')\n",
    "axes[1].set_title('Distribusi Kategori Serangan', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel('Jumlah Sampel')\n",
    "for i, v in enumerate(cat_counts.values):\n",
    "    axes[1].text(v + 500, i, f'{v:,}', va='center', fontsize=10)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('../notebook/label_distribution.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "print(f'\nRasio Normal:Attack = {label_counts[0]:,}:{label_counts[1]:,} = 1:{label_counts[1]/label_counts[0]:.2f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Distribusi Feature Numerik"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "numeric_cols = df_train.select_dtypes(include=[np.number]).columns.tolist()\n",
    "numeric_cols = [c for c in numeric_cols if c not in ['label']]\n",
    "print(f'Jumlah fitur numerik: {len(numeric_cols)}')\n",
    "print(f'Kolom: {numeric_cols}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Histogram untuk beberapa fitur numerik penting\n",
    "key_features = ['dur', 'sbytes', 'dbytes', 'rate', 'sload', 'dload', 'spkts', 'dpkts']\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 4, figsize=(18, 8))\n",
    "axes = axes.flatten()\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, col in enumerate(key_features):\n",
    "    axes[i].hist(df_train[col], bins=50, color='#3498db', alpha=0.7, edgecolor='white')\n",
    "    axes[i].set_title(f'{col}', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    axes[i].set_xlabel('')\n",
    "    axes[i].set_ylabel('Frekuensi')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Hide empty subplot\n",
    "axes[-1].axis('off')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle('Histogram Fitur Numerik Utama', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold', y=1.02)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('../notebook/feature_histograms.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Boxplot untuk deteksi outlier\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 4, figsize=(18, 8))\n",
    "axes = axes.flatten()\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, col in enumerate(key_features):\n",
    "    bp = axes[i].boxplot(df_train[col].dropna(), vert=True, patch_artist=True,\n",
    "                         boxprops=dict(facecolor='#a8d8ea', color='#2980b9'),\n",
    "                         medianprops=dict(color='#e74c3c', linewidth=2),\n",
    "                         flierprops=dict(marker='o', markerfacecolor='#e74c3c',\n",
    "                                        markersize=3, alpha=0.5))\n",
    "    axes[i].set_title(f'{col}', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[-1].axis('off')\n",
    "plt.suptitle('Boxplot Fitur Numerik (Outlier Detection)', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold', y=1.02)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('../notebook/feature_boxplots.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Distribusi Feature Kategorikal"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "categorical_cols = ['proto', 'service', 'state']\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(20, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, col in enumerate(categorical_cols):\n",
    "    counts = df_train[col].value_counts().head(15)  # Top 15\n",
    "    axes[i].barh(counts.index.astype(str), counts.values, color=plt.cm.Pastel1(i/3),\n",
    "                  edgecolor='white')\n",
    "    axes[i].set_title(f'Distribusi {col} (Top 15)', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    axes[i].set_xlabel('Jumlah')\n",
    "    for j, v in enumerate(counts.values):\n",
    "        axes[i].text(v + 100, j, f'{v:,}', va='center', fontsize=9)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('../notebook/categorical_distribution.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "for col in categorical_cols:\n",
    "    print(f'\n{col}: {df_train[col].nunique()} unique values')\n",
    "    print(f'  Top 5: {df_train[col].value_counts().head(5).to_dict()}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Korelasi Fitur"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Korelasi antar fitur numerik dengan label\n",
    "corr_matrix = df_train[numeric_cols + ['label']].corr()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Top 10 fitur dengan korelasi tertinggi terhadap label\n",
    "label_corr = corr_matrix['label'].drop('label').abs().sort_values(ascending=False).head(15)\n",
    "print('Top 15 Fitur dengan Korelasi Tertinggi terhadap Label:')\n",
    "for feat, corr_val in label_corr.items():\n",
    "    print(f'  {feat}: {corr_val:.4f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Heatmap korelasi untuk top 15 fitur\n",
    "top_features = label_corr.index.tolist() + ['label']\n",
    "corr_top = df_train[top_features].corr()\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(14, 10))\n",
    "mask = np.triu(np.ones_like(corr_top, dtype=bool))\n",
    "sns.heatmap(corr_top, annot=True, fmt='.2f', cmap='RdBu_r', center=0,\n",
    "            mask=mask, square=True, linewidths=0.5,\n",
    "            annot_kws={'size': 8})\n",
    "plt.title('Heatmap Korelasi Top 15 Fitur', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('../notebook/correlation_heatmap.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 9. Statistik Deskriptif"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('=== Statistik Deskriptif Training Set ===')\n",
    "df_train.describe().T"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 10. Kesimpulan EDA"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Ringkasan Temuan:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Shape Dataset**:\n",
    "   - Training: 175,341 baris x 36 kolom\n",
    "   - Testing: 82,332 baris x 36 kolom\n",
    "   - Total: 257,673 baris\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Missing Value**:\n",
    "   - Tidak ada missing value pada training maupun testing set.\n",
    "   - Tidak perlu dilakukan imputasi.\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Tipe Data":\n",
    "   - Numerik (float32, int8, int16, int32, int64): 32 kolom\n",
    "   - Kategorikal (category): 4 kolom (proto, service, state, attack_cat)\n",
    "   - Target (label): int8, bersifat biner (0 = Normal, 1 = Attack)\n",
    "\n",
    "4. **Distribusi Label**:\n",
    "   - Normal: 56,000 (31.9%)\n",
    "   - Attack: 119,341 (68.1%)\n",
    "   - Terdapat **class imbalance** yang perlu diperhatikan\n",
    "   - 10 kategori serangan: Normal, Generic, Exploits, Fuzzers, DoS, Reconnaissance, Analysis, Backdoor, Shellcode, Worms\n",
    "\n",
    "5. **Distribusi Fitur**:\n",
    "   - Sebagian besar fitur numerik memiliki distribusi skewed (right-skewed)\n",
    "   - Banyak outlier terdeteksi pada fitur seperti sbytes, dbytes, sload, dload\n",
    "   - Normalisasi diperlukan untuk mengatasi perbedaan skala\n",
    "\n",
    "6. **Korelasi**:\n",
    "   - Beberapa fitur menunjukkan korelasi kuat dengan label\n",
    "   - Fitur koneksi (spkts, dpkts, sbytes, dbytes) memiliki korelasi signifikan\n",
    "   - Beberapa fitur saling berkorelasi tinggi (multicollinearity)\n",
    "\n",
    "7. **Langkah Selanjutnya**:\n",
    "   - Normalisasi fitur numerik menggunakan Z-score\n",
    "   - Encoding fitur kategorikal menggunakan vocabulary-based encoding\n",
    "   - Kolom attack_cat tidak digunakan sebagai fitur (hanya informasi)\n",
    "   - Label tetap sebagai biner (0/1) untuk klasifikasi binary\n",
    "   - Menggunakan TFX pipeline untuk end-to-end ML workflow"
   ]
  }
 ],
